{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix' data-target='computer\/os\/nix' data-title='*Nix'>\r\n\t\t\t*Nix\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-title='SSH'>\r\n\t\t\tSSH\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Configure sshd, place authorized_keys, set permissions, restart the Ubuntu ssh service, and lock down root password login.","label":"SSH","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect","label":"Reconnect","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh_debug","label":"SSH debug","url":"\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh_debug"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tConfigure the SSH server (SSHD).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Configure server (SSHD)<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>\/etc\/sshd\n\/etc\/ssh\/sshd_config<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Effective SSHD config<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>grep -v \"^#\" \/etc\/ssh\/sshd_config | grep -v \"^$\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>AuthorizedKeysFile      [%h\/].ssh\/authorized_keys<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Place public key<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>~\/.ssh\/authorized_keys<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFormat, single line:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>[IP&lt;space&gt;]&lt;sha256&gt;&lt;ssh-rsa&gt;&lt;space&gt;&lt;&lt;key&gt;[=...]&gt;[&lt;space&gt;&lt;Comment&gt;]<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Restrict permission to user<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>chmod 0700 ~\/.ssh\nchmod 0600 ~\/.ssh\/authorized_keys<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Restart SSHD<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tOn Ubuntu, even though the service is called sshd:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>sudo service ssh restart<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Log<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>tail -f \/var\/log\/auth.log<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>Lockdown root password login<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIn <code class='inline'>\/etc\/ssh\/sshd_config<\/code>:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>PermitRootLogin without-password<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReload sshd by PID:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ps auxw | grep ssh\nkill -HUP &lt;PID&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCaution: <code class='inline'>kill -HUP<\/code> reloads sshd; a bad config can lock you out.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/reconnect' data-title='Reconnect' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Reconnect<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh_debug' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh\/ssh_debug' data-title='SSH debug' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SSH debug<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-target='computer\/os\/nix\/ssh' data-title='SSH'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>SSH<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}